{
 "slug": "centralia",
 "lines": [
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Under your feet here, a fire has burned for 64 years. Population: 5. So why did nobody stop it?",
   "chunks": [
    "UNDER YOUR FEET HERE,",
    "A *FIRE* HAS BURNED|FOR *64 YEARS.*",
    "POPULATION: *5.*",
    "SO WHY DID|*NOBODY STOP IT?*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Rewind to 1962. Centralia, Pennsylvania. A coal town of about 1,400 people.",
   "chunks": [
    "REWIND TO *1962.*",
    "*CENTRALIA,*|PENNSYLVANIA.",
    "A COAL TOWN OF|ABOUT *1,400* PEOPLE."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "The story goes, the town burned its trash in an old mining pit.",
   "chunks": [
    "THE STORY GOES,",
    "THE TOWN BURNED|ITS *TRASH*",
    "IN AN OLD|*MINING PIT.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "But that pit sat on old coal mines. And the fire got in.",
   "chunks": [
    "BUT THAT PIT SAT|ON *OLD COAL MINES.*",
    "AND THE *FIRE*|GOT IN."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Ooh. Coal? For me?",
   "chunks": [
    "OOH. *COAL?*",
    "FOR *ME?*"
   ],
   "speaker": "fire"
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So they dug. They flushed. About 42 thousand dollars later, the money ran out... The fire didn't.",
   "chunks": [
    "SO THEY *DUG.*",
    "THEY *FLUSHED.*",
    "ABOUT *42 THOUSAND*|DOLLARS LATER,",
    "THE MONEY|RAN OUT...",
    "THE FIRE *DIDN'T.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So how bad could it get?",
   "chunks": [
    "SO HOW BAD|COULD IT *GET?*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "By 1979, petrol in an underground tank hit 78 degrees Celsius.",
   "chunks": [
    "BY *1979,*",
    "PETROL IN AN|UNDERGROUND TANK",
    "HIT *78 DEGREES*|CELSIUS."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Is it just me... or the ground?",
   "chunks": [
    "IS IT JUST ME...",
    "OR THE *GROUND?*"
   ],
   "speaker": "town"
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "In 1981, the ground opened under a 12-year-old boy. A hole about 45 metres deep.",
   "chunks": [
    "IN *1981,*",
    "THE GROUND OPENED|UNDER A *12-YEAR-OLD* BOY.",
    "A HOLE ABOUT|*45 METRES* DEEP."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "His cousin pulled him out. Now America was watching.",
   "chunks": [
    "HIS *COUSIN*|PULLED HIM OUT.",
    "NOW *AMERICA*|WAS WATCHING."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Putting the fire out? One study said about 663 million dollars.",
   "chunks": [
    "PUTTING THE|*FIRE OUT?*",
    "ONE STUDY SAID ABOUT",
    "*663 MILLION*|DOLLARS."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Moving everyone out? 42 million. Yes... that number again.",
   "chunks": [
    "MOVING|*EVERYONE OUT?*",
    "*42 MILLION.*",
    "YES... THAT|*NUMBER AGAIN.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So America didn't put out the fire... it put out the town.",
   "chunks": [
    "SO AMERICA DIDN'T|PUT OUT THE *FIRE...*",
    "IT PUT OUT|THE *TOWN.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Over 500 homes and shops were bought and torn down. In 2002, even the ZIP code went.",
   "chunks": [
    "OVER *500* HOMES|AND SHOPS",
    "WERE BOUGHT AND|*TORN DOWN.*",
    "IN *2002,*",
    "EVEN THE *ZIP CODE*|WENT."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Today, a handful of people still live there. Steam still rises through the cracks.",
   "chunks": [
    "TODAY, A *HANDFUL*|OF PEOPLE",
    "STILL LIVE THERE.",
    "*STEAM* STILL RISES|THROUGH THE *CRACKS.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "And the twist? At this rate, it could burn for another 250 years.",
   "chunks": [
    "AND THE *TWIST?*",
    "AT THIS RATE,|IT COULD BURN",
    "FOR ANOTHER|*250 YEARS.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Relax. I'm only 64.",
   "chunks": [
    "RELAX.",
    "I'M ONLY *64.*"
   ],
   "speaker": "fire"
  },
